---
const personalImageAlt = 'Angel Leon';
import YearsExperience from '@/components/YearsExperience.astro';
---

<article
	class='flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-8 text-gray-300 md:flex-row'
>
	<div
		class='[&>p]:mb-4 [&>p>strong]:text-yellow-100 [&>p>strong]:font-normal [&>p>strong]:font-mono text-pretty order-2 md:order-1'
	>
		<p>
			I'm a <strong
				>Product Engineer with <YearsExperience
					start='2021-05-01'
				/> of experience</strong
			> who enjoys building products end-to-end. My background
			is fully technical—most of my career as a full stack engineer—so
			I bring a strong engineering foundation to every project.
			I've shipped production apps with <strong
				>Angular, React/Next.js</strong
			> and contributed across the stack with <strong
				>Node (Express/Nest)</strong
			>.
		</p>

		<p>
			I care about <strong
				>product impact, user experience, and
				cross-functional collaboration</strong
			>. Lately I've been sharpening my <strong
				>UX/UI and design systems</strong
			> skills to deliver features that solve real user problems
			and drive business outcomes.
		</p>

		<p>
			I thrive working on <strong
				>real product challenges</strong
			>, iterating fast, and measuring impact. I enjoy roles
			where I can bridge design and engineering, and
			collaborate with product, design, and development
			teams. If you're hiring for product engineering roles
			(remote or Spain), let's talk.
		</p>
	</div>

	<img
		width='200'
		height='200'
		src='/me.webp'
		alt={personalImageAlt}
		class='order-1 object-cover w-64 h-full p-1 md:order-2 rotate-3 lg:p-2 lg:w-64 aspect-square rounded-2xl bg-yellow-500/5 ring-1 ring-white/20'
		style='object-position: 50% 50%'
	/>
</article>
